-    caution_breeder_policy => (-1, "mode", -1, 5, "borg_caution.rs:5232", "#722 (owner): the breeder policy, one setting for the breeder switches. -1 = the switches as set (caution_breeder_fight, danger_hunt_breeder_no_acid_fear, recover_rest_breeders, caution_breeder_stoppable, caution_breeder_avoid, caution_breeder_exit). 0 = C (all off). 1 = stand without an easy escape and hunt few breeders below CL10 (#503, #558). 2 = and no rest while breeders are known (#644). 3 = and kill them first while the kills outpace the breeding, at any count and level (#556); the level is lost once more breeders are known than caution_breeder_hunt_max_count (per class) or the breeding outpaces the kills; on a lost level the Borg searches for stairs, and reads Recall after caution_breeder_lost_recall_turns. 4 = and paths avoid colonies (#556). 5 = and walk out of a breeder room (#544)."),
